258
00:21:38.958 --> 00:21:40.551
There's someone down there.

259
00:21:41.333 --> 00:21:42.755
Just wait here, guys. Wait!

260
00:22:10.167 --> 00:22:12.090
Hello?

261
00:22:12.167 --> 00:22:15.171
