265
00:22:29.333 --> 00:22:30.425
Ed.

266
00:22:32.708 --> 00:22:34.460
Wait a sec, guys.

267
00:22:34.958 --> 00:22:36.631
Hello?

268
00:22:39.625 --> 00:22:41.593
