- I think so, too.

277
00:23:02.875 --> 00:23:04.843
We can think, but we don't fucking know.

278
00:23:04.917 --> 00:23:07.340
(Rob) Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Guys, it's made of wood.

279
00:23:08.792 --> 00:23:12.251
