- This is insane. What are you doing?

280
00:23:12.333 --> 00:23:14.961
Get down here! Help us.
Fucking kneel down and help.

281
00:23:15.042 --> 00:23:17.295
- Come on!
- (girl yells)

282
00:23:19.625 --> 00:23:22.879
