¶ Delusions, oppressions
and murderous wars

914
01:35:07.500 --> 01:35:13.086
¶ We dare na weel say't
but we ken wha's to blame

915
01:35:13.167 --> 01:35:19.925
¶ There'll never be peace
till Jamie comes hame

916
