¶ My seven braw sons
for Jamie drew sword

917
01:35:26.083 --> 01:35:31.840
¶ And now I greet round
their green beds in the yerd

918
01:35:31.917 --> 01:35:37.595
¶ It brak the sweet heart
o' my faithful auld dame

919
